title: A reader cannot edit; made a writer it edits and its save writes the host's file; made a reader again it cannot
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02W1\.\nline 03\n
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: (?s)^(?!.*(R0|R1|R2)).*$
guest-expect-log: script: cannot edit 'notes.txt'

wait 3000
share join nothing Ana
share start
wait 13000
share writer Beto
wait 7000
share reader Beto
wait 2500
share panel
wait 1500
mark host-beto-reads-again
wait 6000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
goto notes.txt
wait 1200
tool edit
edit notes.txt 2 1
type R0.
wait 1500
share panel
wait 1200
mark as-reader
wait 800
share panel close
wait 3000
edit notes.txt 2 1
key end
type W1.
wait 800
key save
wait 1500
mark as-writer
wait 3500
type R1.
wait 300
edit notes.txt 2 1
type R2.
wait 300
key save
wait 1500
mark reader-again
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
